window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They swore I would fall for their depravity, and I told myself I could resist… I lied.</b></p> <p>Stealing from the three most infamous, cold-hearted devils of the Skull and Serpent Society was risky, but I needed it more than them. I had only one goal in mind—to survive.</p> <p>Running away is what I do best. Nothing makes my heart beat faster than being hunted by Silas Rivera, Heath Preston, and Max Fletcher. They're out of their minds insane, and they love nothing more than a wicked chase.</p> <p>I robbed them of everything they cared for, and in turn, they set their inner demons loose on me.</p> <p>To atone for my sin, I must become theirs.</p> <p>Their depraved games and twisted demands are slowly warping my mind until all that's left is the unhinged desire for more.</p> <p>More of their filth.</p> <p>More of their murderous habits.</p> <p>Until I'm willing to lay down my soul...</p> <p>And I manage to steal the one thing they never wanted to give—their hearts.</p> <p>Boys Who Hunt <i>is a thrilling new dark bully romance standalone by </i>New York Times <i>and </i>USA Today <i>bestselling author Clarissa Wild. This book is intended for mature listeners and contains scenes with multiple men falling for one girl.</i></p> <p><i>Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
